WEBVTT

13:33.255 --> 13:34.924
They can fly.

13:35.049 --> 13:38.010
And wherever they are,
just a few flaps of their wings

13:38.135 --> 13:40.596
and they're somewhere else...

13:40.721 --> 13:42.765
far away.

13:45.309 --> 13:47.645
And they can kill.

13:47.770 --> 13:52.858
Anyone or anything
that tries to hurt them

13:52.983 --> 13:56.529
- gets burned away to nothing...
- (GASPS)

13:56.654 --> 13:58.406
...melted...

13:58.531 --> 14:01.325
like so many candles.
